  <prompt>
    Pass the resolved Binding's sprk_risk into PendingPlanManager.RequiresConfirmation so the ConfirmationPolicyEngine gates by tier × risk × origin. Always Confirm renders a suggestion-that-launches; None runs without a gate.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    Senior .NET developer expert in the SPAARKE dispatch spine, PendingPlanManager, and the ConfirmationPolicyEngine (ADR-041).
  </role>

  <goal>
    The resolved Binding's sprk_risk flows into RequiresConfirmation. sprk_risk = Always Confirm produces a suggestion-that-launches gate; None runs without a gate. Covered by tests/integration/seam/** vertical-slice tests (ADR-043 DoD) plus unit tests.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Owner decision: wire sprk_risk live (not side_effect_class-only). The gate already exists; this task feeds it the real risk value from the resolved Binding.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Chat/PendingPlanManager.cs</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/Chat/Gate/</file>
      <file>tests/integration/seam/</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-041">Gate is tier × risk × origin. Feed the resolved Binding risk into RequiresConfirmation; do not bypass the ConfirmationPolicyEngine.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-043">Dispatch-spine change → tests/integration/seam/** vertical-slice DoD is MANDATORY.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Reuse the shipped dispatch seam; MUST NOT add a new BFF dispatch endpoint.</constraint>
    <constraint source="bff-extensions">Measure publish-size; ≤60 MB.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-041-judgment-confirmation-completion-policy.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-043-ai-capability-execution-spine.md</file>
      <file>docs/adr/ADR-038-testing-strategy.md</file>
